Archive: util-linux-2.40.2.tar.xz
Origname: util-linux-2.40.2
Name: util-linux

    util-linux 2.40.2 with the Fil-C port and two fixes:

    - The version-script linker flags are spelled --version-script=FILE
      instead of -Wl,--version-script,FILE because the Fil-C compiler
      driver does not accept the comma form.

    - lsfd no longer passes an unparenthesized compound literal to the
      C23 const-preserving bsearch macro (the comma inside the braces
      splits the macro invocation).  This is upstream commit
      711bda1441561bfd2eb6d45fe0bc789535c1f1a8, also backported by
      OpenEmbedded.
